# Find app routes inside nested routers on current FastAPI
#
# Fixes: the Codex cookbook bridge endpoints (/cookbook/serve,
# /cookbook/cached, /cookbook/preset/{name}) return 503 because they cannot
# find /api/model/serve and /api/model/cached on the app.
# Why: FastAPI 0.14x keeps each included router as a nested wrapper instead of
# flattening its routes into app.routes, and upstream does not pin FastAPI.
# The lookup now descends into included routers and joins their prefixes.
# Verified live: the image built from upstream gets FastAPI 0.141.1, and the
# old lookup finds nothing there.
# Upstream: not fixed on main or dev at 3b6c1691. Being prepared as an
# upstream pull request.
# Test: tests/test_codex_find_app_endpoint.py (new file)

diff --git a/routes/codex_routes.py b/routes/codex_routes.py
